EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Whaaaa—? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I haven't met you yet!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}. Nice to meet ya.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Don't get too attached, though.
I'm actually moving!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} But it doesn't
mean this isn't a nice place to live
or anything.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} I'm sure you'll love it!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¿Cómo? ¡Si aún no nos conocemos!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}, un placer!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Pero no me cojas cariño...
¡Me marcho del pueblo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Aunque la
verdad es que es un sitio estupendo
para vivir.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} ¡Seguro que te encanta!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Gné ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} J't'ai jamais {{TAG:000E:0006:0400760075000600760075006500}}, toi !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Chuis
{{TAG:0005:0001:}} ! Ravie d'te rencontrer,
même si ce s'ra bref...
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Chuis sur l'point d'quitter la ville !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Pas qu'elle m'déplaise ou quoi, hein.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}D'ailleurs, j'parie qu'tu t'y plais.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Neee—? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Daha tanışmadık bile!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Ben
{{TAG:0005:0001:}}. Tanıştığımıza sevindim.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Ama hemen alışma bana. Aslında taşınıyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Bu, buranın yaşanacak güzel bir yer
olmadığı anlamına gelmiyor tabii.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Eminim
burayı seveceksin!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Tiens, tiens, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}T'es {{TAG:000E:0006:0800760065006E0075000A00760065006E0075006500}}
t'balader en ville ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Quel drôle de
coïncidence !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Moi, j'pars demain !
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bon, chais pas encore où j'vais{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}J'verrai bien où mes pattes me
conduiront !
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hi hi, j'dis pas ça pour m'la jouer,
j'ai vraiment rien d'prévu !{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Viens dans ma ville !
Arrête de te la péter !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Wenn das mal nicht {{TAG:0005:0008:}} is'!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Biste hier zu Besuch?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Du wirst es
nicht glauben, ich ziehe morgen um!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich weiß nur noch nicht, wohin{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich lass mich einfach vom Schicksal
treiben – bin ich nicht krass?!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Meine Stadt ist toll!
Du bist zu krass!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Pero bueno! ¡Cómo eres! Deberías
ser más educad{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} con la gente que
se marcha...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}En fin, ¡tú pásate por {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
cuando quieras! ¡Aunque yo no esté!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hold up! I haven't seen you before{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you a visitor?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's probably a good omen to meet
someone from another town just
before I move, don't you think?
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Perhaps the winds of fortune will
guide me to a new destination{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Man, that sounded really dumb!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Come live in my town!
That did sound dumb!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Huch! Wir kennen uns ja gar nicht{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Du bist nicht von hier, oder?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ist doch ein gutes Zeichen, dass ich
jemanden aus 'ner anderen Stadt
treffe, wenn ich umziehen möchte!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Vielleicht ist das ja 'n Wink mit dem
Zaunpfahl von Fortuna persönlich{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mann, hört sich das uncool an!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Komm in meine Stadt!
Das klang echt uncool!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Bir dakika! Seni daha önce görmedim{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ziyaretçi misin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Taşınmadan hemen
önce başka kasabadan biriyle tanışmak iyiye
işaret olmalı, değil mi? {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Belki talihin
rüzgârı beni yeni bir yere götürür{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Off, bu da bayağı saçma duyuldu!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Kasabama taşın!
Evet, saçma oldu!
